  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development would fail to provide a satisfactory standard of accommodation for future occupiers. In particular, Flats A and B would provide substandard living accommodation by reason of inadequate internal space standards. Flat B would further fail to provide adequate floor-to-ceiling heights and private outdoor amenity space. Furthermore, the poor internal vertical stacking arrangement whereby the principal living accommodation of Flat B would be positioned directly above a bedroom serving Flat A, would give rise to a foreseeable risk of noise transmission and disturbance to future occupiers. The proposal would therefore result in unacceptable living conditions for future occupiers and would be contrary to National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021), the Housing Design Standards LPG (2023), Policies CP4 and CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD5, DMD8 and DMD9 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
  ],
